mfa.go:34-37 `// validateTOTP 校验动态验证码（pquerna/otp 默认容忍 ±1 个 30 秒时间窗）。
func validateTOTP(code, secret string) bool {
	return totp.Validate(code, secret)
}` — pquerna/otp v1.4.0 totp/totp.go:37-49 uses `Period: 30, Skew: 1, Digits: otp.DigitsSix, Algorithm: otp.AlgorithmSHA1`, i.e. a 3-step (up to 90 s) acceptance window, and provides no counter state. The call sites pass no identity/context: auth.go:57, auth.go:94, auth.go:236 (`if !validateTOTP(req.Code, secret) {` in mfaEnable) and auth.go:268 (`if validateTOTP(req.Code, u.MFASecret) {` in mfaDisable). Nothing in the repository stores a used-step per user (grep for `jti|revok|last_` finds no TOTP state).

server.go:108-115 `func clientIP(c *gin.Context) string {
	if v := c.GetHeader("X-Forwarded-For"); v != "" {
		if i := strings.IndexByte(v, ','); i > 0 {
			return strings.TrimSpace(v[:i])
		}
		return v
	}
	return c.ClientIP()
}` — used for every admin write at server.go:94-96 `audit.LogOp(s.db, operatorOf(c), action, module, target, before, after, clientIP(c), ...)`, including the login record (auth.go:132 `s.recordOp(c, "login", "auth", u.Username, nil, nil)`), password change (auth.go:182), mfa_bind/mfa_unbind (auth.go:247, auth.go:280) and users.go:50/63.
